Mark only — the symbol with no wordmark, for avatars, favicons and stamps.
SVG is canonical.

  ga-mark.svg         full colour, navy + cherry. The default.
  ga-mark-navy.svg    single colour, navy, on light grounds
  ga-mark-sand.svg    reversed, sand, full-colour contexts
  ga-mark-white.svg   reversed, #FFFFFF, black-and-white documents only
  ga-mark-black.svg   single colour, #000000

No artwork yet. The navy recolour is complete for the primary lockup (logo
revision 1.1.0); these files simply have not been drawn. Sources must be
tight-cropped — see ../README.md.
